    "html": "<p>A stone of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\"></span> kg is thrown vertically downwards from the top of a cliff. The initial kinetic energy of the stone is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200\"></span> J. When the stone hits the ground, its kinetic energy is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600\"></span> J. Air resistance is negligible. What is the height of the cliff?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> m</li>\n</ol>"
